{"5205300":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Coast is Clear: Tidy up the Beach!","steam_appid":5205300,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5332000],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can save the beach from all of its plastic trash. Sort the stores, chairs and beach toys, clean up the beach and restore the coral reef! Save the turtles as you pick up and sort all 11,625 items!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/55a1952b706c29767deb67ad2b4eb1bd.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/55a1952b706c29767deb67ad2b4eb1bd.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/55a1952b706c29767deb67ad2b4eb1bd.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAVE THE CORAL REEF<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/387670794ead04a38f64886b9dda5763.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/387670794ead04a38f64886b9dda5763.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/387670794ead04a38f64886b9dda5763.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COLLECT<\/strong> - Pick up trash from the beach, the ocean and the pier<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SORT<\/strong> - Clean up the stores, the surf rentals and beach toys<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UPGRADE<\/strong> - Use the auto-sorter to speed things up and hire a dog to help carry the trash<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GET HELP ALONG THE WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/a78337be67118a0e318a41fab61acd6e.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/a78337be67118a0e318a41fab61acd6e.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/a78337be67118a0e318a41fab61acd6e.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the sound of the waves crashing as you diligently clean up the beach by yourself or with friends. Take long walks on the beach with your friends and get a taste of summer by shooting water guns, throwing coconuts and crabs... or shooting the seagull gun?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GET A TASTE OF SUMMER<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/76e2b8d36c184425dfef852afa838192.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/76e2b8d36c184425dfef852afa838192.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/76e2b8d36c184425dfef852afa838192.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing cleaning experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort trash into the correct bins<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort clothing stores, beach toys and surfboards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place back all lounge chairs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items and skills to clean up faster<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have some summer fun with funny items in multiplayer, with both online and local co-op support!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the turtles and the coral reef<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization unlocks as you sort the stores<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/2925ae832a4cb8b104e31c2b17971a20.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/2925ae832a4cb8b104e31c2b17971a20.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/2925ae832a4cb8b104e31c2b17971a20.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can save the beach from all of its plastic trash. Sort the stores, chairs and beach toys, clean up the beach and restore the coral reef! Save the turtles as you pick up and sort all 11,625 items!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/55a1952b706c29767deb67ad2b4eb1bd.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/55a1952b706c29767deb67ad2b4eb1bd.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/55a1952b706c29767deb67ad2b4eb1bd.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAVE THE CORAL REEF<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/387670794ead04a38f64886b9dda5763.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/387670794ead04a38f64886b9dda5763.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/387670794ead04a38f64886b9dda5763.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COLLECT<\/strong> - Pick up trash from the beach, the ocean and the pier<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SORT<\/strong> - Clean up the stores, the surf rentals and beach toys<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UPGRADE<\/strong> - Use the auto-sorter to speed things up and hire a dog to help carry the trash<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GET HELP ALONG THE WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/a78337be67118a0e318a41fab61acd6e.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/a78337be67118a0e318a41fab61acd6e.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/a78337be67118a0e318a41fab61acd6e.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the sound of the waves crashing as you diligently clean up the beach by yourself or with friends. Take long walks on the beach with your friends and get a taste of summer by shooting water guns, throwing coconuts and crabs... or shooting the seagull gun?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GET A TASTE OF SUMMER<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/76e2b8d36c184425dfef852afa838192.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/76e2b8d36c184425dfef852afa838192.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/76e2b8d36c184425dfef852afa838192.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing cleaning experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort trash into the correct bins<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort clothing stores, beach toys and surfboards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place back all lounge chairs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items and skills to clean up faster<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have some summer fun with funny items in multiplayer, with both online and local co-op support!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the turtles and the coral reef<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization unlocks as you sort the stores<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/2925ae832a4cb8b104e31c2b17971a20.poster.avif?t=1793728289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/2925ae832a4cb8b104e31c2b17971a20.webm?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/extras\/2925ae832a4cb8b104e31c2b17971a20.mp4?t=1793728289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Save the turtles and bring the beach back to life! Summer's over, and the visitors have left a mess. Collect and sort litter, upgrade your tools and restore the coral reef in this relaxing cleanup game, solo or with friends.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/30709f614f212b2a891a7038f80c2dbd790adbea\/header.jpg?t=1793728289","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5205300\/324d137f46b83a67f